      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Straight and simple solution to protect own avatar from being ripped. Also being able to manage access to uploaded data would put responsibility for data safety on user side. But might be better if it was implemented with whitelist/friendlist. I still shocked this ticket is so underrated.",
