      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f31eb2dd6e61a722e132cec|full_name}: I've come to find out that all avatars uploaded to VRChat are vulnerable, so this idea of protection is only a mitigation for those without a specific client. Someone claimed to be able to rip any avatar, so I uploaded a new one as private and never used it. Sure enough they took 5 minutes and had it up in front of me. :'(",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
