  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-24T16:16:25.638Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This would address multiple issues and increase confidence in using personalized avatars.\n- Reduced avatar theft in all instances.\n- Encouraged consistency for players to use their preferred avatars across all instances.\n- As a byproduct, NSFW avatars would be mutually consented upon to have shown.\n- Reduced load in times when joining larger instances.\n- Until expressly permitted; other players will see the fallback avatar if they show your avatar, but you choose not to reveal on your end.",
